OL,3,GNEWSALollipop men and women to wear
OL,4,Abody-worn cameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FLollipop men and women at some
OL,7,Fcrossings in West Sussex are to be
OL,8,Fgiven bodycams.
OL,10,FThe scheme follows reports of dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving, drivers failing to stop at
OL,12,Fcrossings, and incidents of verbal
OL,13,Fabuse towards school crossing patrol
OL,14,Fofficers.
OL,16,FA successful four-week trial took place
OL,17,Fat selected schools in the county
OL,18,Fearlier this year, with incidents
OL,19,Fhalved where the cameras were in use.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
